        "title": "HOW TO USE",
        "subtitle": "Handwash",
        "description": "<p>Hand washing clothes using detergent sheets is a convenient and effective way to clean your clothes whether for delicates or that sweet summer vacay. Here are the steps to follow:</p><ul><li>Fill a basin or sink with cold water.</li><li>Add one or two detergent sheets to the water until dissolved</li><li>Add your clothes to the basin or sink and let them soak for 10-15 minutes.</li><li>Gently rub the clothes together to remove dirt and stains. Rinse thoroughly with cold water. Squeeze out the excess water and hang the clothes to dry.</li></ul>",
